  "goodToKnow": "Der Kommandant (die Kommandantin) is a commander or commanding officer: der Kommandant eines Schiffes, der Lagerkommandant. In Bavaria, Austria and Switzerland, the head of the volunteer fire brigade is der Feuerwehrkommandant. It's a weak noun: den Kommandanten. The ship's captain is also der Kapitän. Die Kommandantur is the commander's headquarters."
